  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An object of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> is being heated by a source of constant power <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"P\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The rate of change of the temperature of the object is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"S\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the specific heat capacity of the object?<br/><br/></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mS}{P}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mP}{S}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{S}{mP}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{P}{mS}\"></span></li></ol>"
